          q: 'The ERP only backflushes an order’s material when the good parts are confirmed. What happens to the material of the scrapped parts?',
          options: ['It is booked automatically and separately as waste', 'It is still in ERP stock, but it is gone', 'It is booked twice on the next order', 'The ERP sends an alarm to the PLC at once'],
