          q: 'On the line stands a Windows PC with a machine’s operating software. Who is responsible for the Windows updates on that PC in most plants?',
          options: ['Often nobody: it falls between IT, OT and the builder', 'Always IT, because it is simply a Windows PC', 'Always the machine builder, because he supplied the PC', 'The operator, because he works with it every day'],
